炸的七章故事\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q005\",\"source\":\"Learned the eight chapters of the Spellblaze Chronicles.\",\"target\":\"阅读了有关魔法大爆炸的8章文献。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q006\",\"source\":\"Quest #CIMSON#Failed!\",\"target\":\"主线任务 #CIMSON#失败了！\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q007\",\"source\":\"You must wear this object to use it!\",\"target\":\"你必须装备这件物品才能使用它！\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q008\",\"source\":\"Click to copy to clipboard. You can share the wanderer seed with your friends, this way they can play with the same set of talents.\",\"target\":\"点击复制。你可以将流浪者随机种子分享给朋友，这样你们可以用同一套技能组合进行游玩。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q009\",\"source\":\"Spare me the small talk. I am here to stop you!\",\"target\":\"我不是来和你们聊天的，我是来阻止你们的！\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q010\",\"source\":\"#GOLD##{bold}#Display mouse gesture trails#WHITE##{normal}#\",\"target\":\"#GOLD##{bold}#隐藏鼠标手势轨迹#WHITE##{normal}#\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q011\",\"source\":\"I cannot, but I may show you a glimpse.\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*He leans toward you. Your mind is suddenly filled with feelings of peace and happiness.*#WHITE#\\nThis is the Way.\",\"target\":\"不行，不过我可以让你看一下。\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*他靠向你，你的脑海里突然充满了平静和幸福。*#WHITE#\\n这不是维网。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q012\",\"source\":\"Open profile(in browser)\",\"target\":\"打开我的用户信息（在浏览器里打开）\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q013\",\"source\":\"which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Ik AMAKTHEL cosio SHER'TUL, ik baladath peris furko masa bren doth benna zi, ik blod is \\\"Fen makel ath goru domus ik denz tro ala fron.\\\"'#{normal}#\",\"target\":\"即使你懂夏·图尔语也无法理解的文字：#{italic}#'Ik AMAKTHEL cosio SHER'TUL, ik baladath peris furko masa bren doth benna zi, ik blod is \\\"Fen makel ath goru domus ik denz tro ala fron.\\\"'#{normal}#\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q014\",\"source\":\"Donated at least 16 euros to Tales of Maj'Eyal.\",\"target\":\"为马基·埃亚尔的传说捐赠至少 16 欧元，达到白银捐赠等级。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q015\",\"source\":\"Earned the rank of Destroyer in the arena.\",\"target\":\"在竞技场中获得“毁灭者”称号。\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q016\",\"source\":\"DEBUG -- Alter Faction\",\"